{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Basic"],"declarations":14,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.pentagon_ascension","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.pentagon_ascension","kind":"theorem","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.lean#L92-L92","doc":"Pentagon ascension: the level-≥3 contribution vanishes.  This is\nthe categorical content of `prop:mass-endomorphism-tower`\n§\"Pentagon ascension\".  Cf. gemini-code-assist review on\nPR #535. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.level3plus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.level3plus","kind":"def","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.lean#L87-L87","doc":"The cumulative level-≥3 GS-filtration contribution to the mass.\nPentagon ascension says this vanishes at fixed jet level `n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.mass_sum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.mass_sum","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.lean#L83-L83","doc":"The mass formula sums over the four levels. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.level2_non_adj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.level2_non_adj","kind":"def","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.lean#L81-L81","doc":"Level-2 non-adjacent-pair summand. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.level2_adj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.level2_adj","kind":"def","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.lean#L79-L79","doc":"Level-2 adjacent-pair summand `z² · Σ_{adj} Φ_q(‖V̂_i V̂_j‖_F)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.level1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.level1","kind":"def","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.lean#L77-L77","doc":"Level-1 summand `Σ_{|S|=1} Φ_q(‖V̂_S‖_F)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.level0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.level0","kind":"def","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.lean#L75-L75","doc":"Level-0 (descended) summand `‖tr_M(ρ(β_∅))‖_F`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.mass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.mass","kind":"def","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.lean#L73-L73","doc":"Categorical mass `𝔪(ϱ)` of the vortex. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.frobeniusNorm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.frobeniusNorm","kind":"def","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.lean#L71-L71","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.v_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.v_sq","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.lean#L70-L70","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.v","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.v","kind":"def","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.lean#L69-L69","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.q","kind":"def","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.lean#L68-L68","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.mk","kind":"ctor","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.lean#L67-L67","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification","kind":"class","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PhiQTowerAlgebraicStratification.lean#L41-L92","doc":"**Algebraic stratification of the Φ_q tower.**\n\nA `(R, q)`-valued formal datum recording the four-piece\ndecomposition of the mass formula by GS-filtration depth.  Caller\nsupplies:\n\n* `R` — ground ring (typically `R ⊇ ℤ[q^{±1/2}]`),\n* `q v : R` with `v² = q`,\n* `frobeniusNorm : R → R` — the categorical Frobenius norm on\n  the Hecke algebra,\n* the four sums (`level0`, `level1`, `level2_adj`, `level2_non_adj`)\n  that appear on the right-hand side of the mass formula,\n* the equality `mass = level0 + level1 + level2_adj + level2_non_adj`,\n* the audit hypothesis `pentagon_ascension : level≥3 = 0` saying\n  that no level-3 contribution survives at fixed jet level `n`.\n\nThe class field `level_zero_descended` records that the level-0\nsummand is `‖tr_M(ρ(β_∅))‖_F` (the descended carrier); the field\n`levels_in_R` records that every level lives in the ground ring\n(no Archimedean leakage).  These witness the algebraic-side\ndiscipline.\n\nThis statement is **unconditional**: it does *not* depend on\n`[VolumeConjecture q]` or any τ_arch hypothesis.  Compare\n`QOU.PhiQJSJ.bridge` (the conjectural Archimedean bridge), which\n*does* depend on `[VolumeConjecture q]`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}